From: Claude <claude@buttzeppelin>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 15:30:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-223: ZepGrassWind (wxl-grasswind port) +
 vertex-shader and clutter-constant seams

- RenderScript::OnVertexShaderCreate lets an extension swap a vertex shader's bytecode at create time
- RenderScript::OnDetailDoodadConstants exposes the clutter constant block (c14..c21 are free)
- ZepGrassWind injects wind + player parting into the stock clutter VS; handles Wine's d3dcompiler syntax
- ZEP_GRASS_AMPLITUDE test knob

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
